    <p class="body rv d2">This is the full scope of work for this option. Six of these seven lines are word for word identical on every option, because that work does not change with the panel. The one marked in gold is the entire difference.</p>
    <div class="scopekey rv d2"><span class="only"><i></i>Only in this option</span><span><i></i>Same in every option</span></div>
